  "releaseNotes": "- Enhanced GetTypeFromT and app-setting helpers with Double/Decimal conversion, numeric minimum values, trimmed settings, and robust defaults.\n\t\t  - Preserved the existing two-parameter public overloads while adding minimum-value overloads for binary compatibility.\n\t\t  - Updated FixErrors HTML settings to use the centralized app-setting fallback behavior.\n\t\t  - Added characterization coverage for numeric conversion and overload compatibility.\n\t\t  - Added a migration sync guard for pending DVO.Core SVN revisions before modern release candidates.\n\t\t  - Nuget package update.",
